  "agent": {
    "note": "**v1 PROD GATE — `@m0saic/alpine/treemap/v2`** (gate 12 — THE LAST ALPINE GATE; chart: `.ai/LAUNCH/v1-template-cut.md`). Props = showcase defaults (Headcount, 5 tiles). v1 deprecated → rides base·dep.\n\n| Stage | Current | Proposed |\n|---|---|---|\n| Flags | not internal, not deprecated, primitive:true | confirm |\n| Gate | — | **base** |\n| Preview assets | re-mint after approval | review |\n| Cover / Tutorial | cover BUILT this gate (tiles fade in from blank) | eyeball cover; tutorial needed? |\n\n**Pre-audit found + fixed 2 REAL render-refusal bugs (20/84 baseline battery canvases failed, incl. 12-item configs at MOST canvases):**\n1. **Tile label stacks were 100-basis rowSplits inside tile cells** — sub-pixel cells at small tiles → engine folds paint slots → doc refused (the timeline class). Now px/4 weights (the ≥4px-per-weight law).\n2. **Squarify emitted raw px² areas as split weights** — the kit rescales to a 120 basis even inside a ~40px strip (0.3px cells → SPLIT_EXCEEDS_AXIS; max12@360×640 refused). Now px/4 along the split axis; proportions quantize ±2px, invisible.\nBattery 84/84 post-fix (was 64/84).\n\nAlso this gate: script-aware name sizing + truncation (was flat 0.6em), debugLayout contract (textFits on tile-name/tile-value; tiles are value-proportional so no equal relation applies — an area-proportionality rule is noted as a future contract primitive), cover. NOTE: per-side placement.inset keys verified WORKING engine-side (gaps render; the kpi-era lesson was narrower than remembered — insets left as-is).\n\n**Primitive-sense: KEEP primitive:true** — proportional-area tiles are a distinct block (donut shows shares as a ring; treemap as a surface — both earn their seat).\n\nVerified: battery 84/84, probe 14/14, 39/39 unit. Hostile sweeps eyeballed: 12-tile pack, 95%-skew slivers (labels drop cleanly), Cyrillic/CJK tile labels fit.",
    "question": "Default look verdict? Cover OK? Tutorial needed? primitive:true confirmed? Then stress — and the alpine pack closes.",
    "response": {
      "verdict": "ship",
      "text": "default+cover approved (tutorial not needed) → stress x10 pass → \"ship it\"",
      "via": "chat — transcribed by agent",
      "note": "SHIPPED base ☑ — THE ALPINE PACK CLOSES (12/12 gates)."
    }
  }
